Key Terms

PVST+ = Per-VLAN Spanning Tree Plus, Cisco default, one instance per VLAN
PortFast = Skips Listening and Learning, straight to Forwarding
BPDU Guard = err-disabled if BPDU received on PortFast port
BPDU Filter = Stops port from sending/receiving BPDUs
Root Guard = Blocks port if superior BPDU received (prevents rogue root)
Loop Guard = Blocks port if BPDUs stop being received, auto-recovers
err-disabled = Port shutdown by security feature, manually re-enable
root-inconsistent = Port blocked by Root Guard
loop-inconsistent = Port blocked by Loop Guard, auto-recovers
